<title>CHINA: China's Xinhua premium income hits 380 mln yuan.</title>
<headline>China's Xinhua premium income hits 380 mln yuan.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premium income of China's Xinhua Life Insurance Co Ltd totalled 380 million yuan ($45.7 million) from its founding last August to the end of February, the Financial Times said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Xinhua Life was founded in Beijing on August 20, 1996 with a registered capital of 500 million yuan, the newspaper said but gave no further details.</p>
<p>($1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
